00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:39.160
Episode 9

00:01:39.930 --> 00:01:40.730
Late-Stage of Core Formation?

00:01:42.260 --> 00:01:44.800
We can't defeat him even if we have artificial weapons.

00:01:46.260 --> 00:01:49.730
It sounds scary, but how scary is he?

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:53.860
Before, I was ordered to approach you.

00:01:55.460 --> 00:01:58.130
But if we wait for too long, he'll finish his Fiend Art -

00:01:58.660 --> 00:02:00.260
Then he will take your spirit energy by force!

00:02:00.660 --> 00:02:02.600
Eh?! Our spirit energy will be taken away?!

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:06.530
Muzi, how about we run away to a faraway place?

00:02:06.860 --> 00:02:10.530
I'd like to withdraw from society and prepare for our co-cultivation~
If we run away to a faraway place,

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:13.460
Hey! Enough! Both of You!

00:02:13.930 --> 00:02:16.130
Do you really think that my master can't find you?

00:02:16.530 --> 00:02:19.460
Indeed, it's extremely difficult to escape from being killed by your Master.

00:02:19.730 --> 00:02:22.400
Muzi, please give me all your spirit energy.

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:25.130
Maybe I can fight against him in this way.

00:02:26.130 --> 00:02:29.000
Even if I die, I would like to exchange your happy life with my death.

00:02:29.660 --> 00:02:30.600
I'll never forget about you!

00:02:31.060 --> 00:02:31.730
Ying Xiong~

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:37.330
So can we co-cultivate now?

00:02:38.530 --> 00:02:41.930
Enough, You Idiot! The only way to leave this cultivation world is - DEATH!

00:02:42.660 --> 00:02:44.530
Still, how we can accept such a life-and-death struggle?!

00:02:45.130 --> 00:02:47.200
There's a chance, if we work together!

00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:51.200
Ru Yue! A-Are you going to rebel against your Master?!

00:02:52.800 --> 00:02:54.730
He has already been coveting my spirit energy for a long time.

00:02:55.730 --> 00:02:58.200
My instinct is telling me that my death will come soon.

00:02:58.460 --> 00:03:00.460
Please! I can't resign myself to death.

00:03:00.800 --> 00:03:02.800
As long as we work together, we still have chance to live!

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:06.530
Don't accept her request! How can we know that this is not a trap?

00:03:07.260 --> 00:03:10.330
My Master's aptitude is pretty bad and I don't know the reason behind this!

00:03:10.930 --> 00:03:14.660
practitioner's blood, he finally reached Core Formation.
After so many years of taking other

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:18.930
The Foundation Establishment, but if he keep this speed-
In these past years I spend half of my time for training to reach

00:03:18.930 --> 00:03:22.130
I'll die from his hands before I reach Core Formation!

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:27.130
Then If we work together, can we stop him?

00:03:27.730 --> 00:03:30.860
Now his Fiend Art is not yet finish.. Maybe we can make it.

00:03:31.660 --> 00:03:34.200
If not, then we can only pray for a miracle to happen.

00:03:34.800 --> 00:03:36.860
We need to take the advantage of striking him first while he's guard is down.

00:03:36.860 --> 00:03:39.600
But even if the three of us join forces, we can't defeat him.

00:03:41.660 --> 00:03:43.330
His Fiend Art has a fatal weakness.

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:46.800
If we lure him into our trap, maybe there is a chance to beat him!

00:03:47.260 --> 00:03:48.400
Really??

00:03:52.860 --> 00:03:56.850
(¬‿¬)

00:03:56.860 --> 00:03:59.260
This familiar room~ This familiar smell! How can i forget~?

00:03:59.930 --> 00:04:00.530
Muzi..

00:04:00.860 --> 00:04:03.260
Are we finally getting to "that" point?

00:04:07.330 --> 00:04:08.730
You idiot! Don't even think of it!

00:04:09.130 --> 00:04:11.460
Why are you trying to help Ru Yue like a hero again?!

00:04:11.800 --> 00:04:13.660
Well, that's because My Father named me Ying Xiong (HERO).

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:16.800
Putting all his hopes to me so that I can become a real hero.

00:04:18.130 --> 00:04:19.460
Okay, I understand!

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:23.530
Now that you have decided to fight, we need to increase our chances of winning.

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:25.860
I understand, Muzi~

00:04:25.860 --> 00:04:28.860
As long as we co-cultivate together to become one -

00:04:28.930 --> 00:04:30.530
we can reach Core Formation.

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:33.400
What are you thinking, we are not...ready to go for that!

00:04:33.730 --> 00:04:36.330
Huh? Then why did we come to this hotel?

00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:40.600
Ying Xiong, last time when we co-cultivate together..

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:44.530
I saw a white light ball in your consciousness world.

00:04:50.860 --> 00:04:54.730
Light ball? Could it be the symbol of my talent?

00:04:54.930 --> 00:04:58.860
No, I felt that the energy of that light ball is the same as with my family.

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:01.530
And it's not the same spirit energy that you absorbed from me.

00:05:03.060 --> 00:05:05.130
This power is far more greater than any other I've seen till now.

00:05:08.330 --> 00:05:09.930
Although I feel a little confident -

00:05:10.530 --> 00:05:12.800
But i think it's my potential as a practitioner~.

00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:14.000
In short..

00:05:14.800 --> 00:05:17.130
If you can use this energy successfully,

00:05:17.930 --> 00:05:19.800
Maybe we can defeat that old freak.

00:05:21.200 --> 00:05:24.000
Then how can I release this energy out?

00:05:24.730 --> 00:05:28.000
That energy might be similar to artificial weapon or spirit weapon.

00:05:28.530 --> 00:05:32.260
You'll need to use your blood to release it out and form a contract with this power.

00:05:33.370 --> 00:05:35.840
Use blood?

00:05:35.840 --> 00:05:36.710
But you'll need to be careful..

00:05:37.310 --> 00:05:41.170
powerful monsters that dwell inside that weapon.
usually powerful weapon contains spirits of the

00:05:42.240 --> 00:05:43.910
Because they have their own consciousness.

00:05:44.310 --> 00:05:45.970
This gives the weapon an extraordinary power!

00:05:46.910 --> 00:05:49.970
That's good! In this way we'll have a chance of winning!

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:53.570
But it's a little dangerous to release a weapon spirit.

00:05:54.640 --> 00:05:56.640
There's a chance that you might be taken over by the spirit.

00:05:56.910 --> 00:05:58.510
OH MY GOD!

00:05:58.710 --> 00:06:03.970
to co-cultivate with Muzi, then i think...
Does that mean the spirit will take over me

00:06:04.840 --> 00:06:05.840
What are you thinking?!

00:06:06.510 --> 00:06:08.970
Ying Xiong, to release this spirit out or not, you need to decide it by yourself!

00:06:10.170 --> 00:06:13.910
Muzi, you said before, even if we work together with Ru Yue,

00:06:14.310 --> 00:06:16.510
we still can't win against her Master.

00:06:16.840 --> 00:06:21.040
Compared with that, releasing the spirit is full of risk and chance.

00:06:21.370 --> 00:06:23.770
Who knows! We might even release something useful.

00:06:23.840 --> 00:06:26.040
Besides, I've you with my side.

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:29.570
It's seems you've already made up your mind, then

00:06:29.910 --> 00:06:31.570
When should we start?

00:06:34.510 --> 00:06:35.510
See? It's simple~!

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:36.570
WTF?!

00:06:40.910 --> 00:06:42.310
Weapon spirit, release!

00:06:42.910 --> 00:06:43.910
Whoa! It came out!

00:06:44.510 --> 00:06:47.170
Although I don't know what will happen, but I can't back now!

00:06:48.110 --> 00:06:49.570
Take this Monster!

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:02.910
Master, What are you doing?

00:07:03.570 --> 00:07:05.110
Master? Me?!

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:06.770
Master? A girl?!

00:07:07.310 --> 00:07:10.170
I am spirit from an unique treasure.

00:07:10.510 --> 00:07:12.970
I was summoned by Master's blood with a blood agreement method.

00:07:13.310 --> 00:07:14.970
What can I do for you Master?

00:07:20.710 --> 00:07:22.170
I can feel your cultivation level is very high -

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:23.710
if you can release it out.

00:07:24.310 --> 00:07:26.040
Then we won't need to be afraid of that old freak!

00:07:27.240 --> 00:07:29.910
Yes, Master! Indeed my cultivation level is high,

00:07:30.440 --> 00:07:32.240
but if you want to unleash my full power -

00:07:32.440 --> 00:07:34.510
You'll need to be at Ascendant Soul level.

00:07:34.910 --> 00:07:36.910
With Master's current level,

00:07:37.240 --> 00:07:39.770
you can keep me long enough out for a short time.

00:07:40.240 --> 00:07:40.640
Ah!

00:07:40.910 --> 00:07:41.770
Time's up!

00:07:43.310 --> 00:07:43.770
Whoa!

00:07:43.910 --> 00:07:44.970
She left just like that!

00:07:45.570 --> 00:07:47.040
It seems this way won't work.

00:07:47.370 --> 00:07:51.110
Your current cultivation level is not even able to use one percent of its true strength!

00:07:51.510 --> 00:07:54.510
I think so too! I think Co-Cultivation is more reliable!

00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:59.110
now is not the time to think of those things!
What are you thinking? You can sleep on bed but

00:08:05.440 --> 00:08:07.570
I can't use this beautiful girl to fight -

00:08:08.040 --> 00:08:10.910
but she probably have other uses, right?

00:08:10.970 --> 00:08:12.970
Come out girl!

00:08:13.910 --> 00:08:15.240
WTF?! She didn't noticed?

00:08:15.510 --> 00:08:17.510
You fu*$$r &#$@%&$#^& (bla bla bla) (─‿‿─)

00:08:17.710 --> 00:08:18.710
(Ah, this guy is useless) (￣ｰ￣)

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:25.170
Maybe the chant is wrong, it should be 'weapon spirit, show yourself'!

00:08:25.640 --> 00:08:28.910
Master, if you want to summon me just concentrate.

00:08:28.910 --> 00:08:29.740
Why are you hurting yourself?

00:08:29.740 --> 00:08:30.670
Crap! I forgot!

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:36.240
Based on what Ru Yue said-

00:08:37.370 --> 00:08:40.710
Our alliance must be under the rader of my Master.

00:08:41.110 --> 00:08:44.240
While his Fiend Art is incomplete, we'll leave some "trails" of our escape on purpose.

00:08:44.440 --> 00:08:46.710
Then we'll lure him into my 'Yang-Flame Array', and kill him together!

00:08:52.100 --> 00:08:53.100
Yo!

00:08:53.910 --> 00:08:55.240
Can I talk to you about something?

00:08:55.710 --> 00:08:56.240
What?

00:08:56.970 --> 00:08:59.910
Give Li Muzi back to me and I will let you live.

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:02.910
This matter can't be decided by me, it's Muzi's choice!

00:09:03.110 --> 00:09:04.510
Aright! knew you would say this!

00:09:05.040 --> 00:09:06.510
You finally understand?

00:09:07.840 --> 00:09:08.510
However,

00:09:09.170 --> 00:09:12.570
Even I can't win her heart, at least I must get her body.

00:09:12.570 --> 00:09:14.770
I will prove you what is "love" over time.

00:09:15.770 --> 00:09:18.110
If possible, I really don't want to fight with you..

00:09:18.770 --> 00:09:19.770
You are not worthy of fight with me.

00:09:20.110 --> 00:09:21.970
That guy, he indeed has an artificial weapon.

00:09:22.440 --> 00:09:26.440
Nice job! According to our agreement, we'll gave you the woman.

00:09:27.710 --> 00:09:28.840
Kill him!

00:09:33.910 --> 00:09:38.370
With your current level you can't defeat us. If you don't want to die! Get lost!

00:09:38.570 --> 00:09:42.440
It looks like we can have some training before Master arrives.

00:09:45.640 --> 00:09:48.710
Dark Sky and Li Fire. We are so lucky this time~

00:09:48.840 --> 00:09:52.570
Oh? The two of you must be Weapon Hunters, right?

00:09:52.710 --> 00:09:56.510
Hmph! Now that you know, then i suggest you to hand over your weapons quietly!

00:09:56.910 --> 00:09:58.770
If you want it so much, than come here and get it!

00:10:03.710 --> 00:10:04.370
Subdue!

00:10:09.440 --> 00:10:09.970
What is this?

00:10:10.110 --> 00:10:12.370
I can't use my power!

00:10:15.370 --> 00:10:17.970
To fight while relaying on weapons is not a true strength.

00:10:18.510 --> 00:10:22.310
Although I don't know how you did it,

00:10:22.640 --> 00:10:26.040
But nice work, I can take both of them tonight~

00:10:26.570 --> 00:10:29.310
As long as I'm here, I won't let you to hurt them!

00:10:30.310 --> 00:10:32.710
I want to know how long you can act hero like that~

00:10:53.370 --> 00:10:54.040
Ying Xiong!!

00:10:54.240 --> 00:10:56.710
Hey, do you think bullying new people are a lot of fun?!

00:10:57.040 --> 00:10:58.310
Yes, it is~

00:11:06.910 --> 00:11:08.240
Hand over your weapons!

00:11:08.510 --> 00:11:10.240
Maybe i can spare this guy!

00:11:12.370 --> 00:11:14.370
Don't hand over Dark Sky to this asshole!

00:11:14.840 --> 00:11:15.440
Ying Xiong

00:11:15.640 --> 00:11:16.910
I'll never forgive you!

00:11:17.240 --> 00:11:20.110
To think you dare to take away her first time's bondage binding play from me...

00:11:22.370 --> 00:11:23.910
I'll never forgive you....

00:11:27.310 --> 00:11:28.310
Ying Xiong!

00:11:30.640 --> 00:11:32.110
Master, are you okay?

00:11:32.370 --> 00:11:33.310
I'm alive...

00:11:33.770 --> 00:11:35.570
What's your next order?

00:11:35.840 --> 00:11:37.640
Save Muzi and Ru Yue now!

00:11:38.040 --> 00:11:38.310
Understood!

00:11:55.480 --> 00:11:56.480
So strong...

00:12:00.550 --> 00:12:03.280
I'm sorry, I'm sorry, Please forgive us! We failed to recognize such great persons!

00:12:03.350 --> 00:12:07.680
Please don't kill us! We just wanted to make some money!

00:12:08.550 --> 00:12:11.080
I'll give you 10 seconds to roll out of my sight!

00:12:11.420 --> 00:12:13.750
Thank You! Thank You!

00:12:14.020 --> 00:12:16.550
Hey, remember to roll!

00:12:18.680 --> 00:12:20.880
Hey, still can't forget about me?!

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:25.750
I know you two are the best~!

00:12:25.750 --> 00:12:27.150
Care to explain...this please?

00:12:27.480 --> 00:12:29.550
What's the meaning of "bondage binding play"?

00:12:29.550 --> 00:12:32.950
Master, why does your face look like you are going to met hell?

00:12:33.220 --> 00:12:35.620
Haa? So I look like hell in your heart?!

00:12:36.250 --> 00:12:36.280
Ah, it's not!

00:12:36.280 --> 00:12:37.050
Don't you run! stop running!
Ah, it's not!

00:12:37.050 --> 00:12:38.280
Don't you run! stop running!

00:12:39.750 --> 00:12:40.480
Ma Ying Xiong!

00:12:45.820 --> 00:12:47.750
Ru Yue, you've done well.

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:53.220
Few days later, all of you'll become the sacrificial offerings for me to reach Late-Stage of Core Formation.

00:12:59.450 --> 00:13:06.190
Waken at nightfall  It's the whisper of waves

00:13:06.190 --> 00:13:11.920
The scenery outside the window is dyed red by the afterglow

00:13:13.250 --> 00:13:20.320
Scattered time   Blank mood

00:13:20.320 --> 00:13:25.050
No one is along with me to the dawn time

00:13:26.390 --> 00:13:33.450
Wind is passed   Ear is listening

00:13:33.450 --> 00:13:38.990
Could I hear the sound of your heart beat?

00:13:39.790 --> 00:13:46.990
Let this wind blows hair to the air

00:13:46.990 --> 00:13:53.790
Pitter-patter is perpetual Bit bit drops into my heart

00:13:53.790 --> 00:14:00.720
Rose in the vase rises her white body sideways

00:14:00.720 --> 00:14:05.850
It rejects of dying alone
